<div class="ui vertical segment">
  <div class="ui middle aligned stackable centered grid container home-page-container">
    <h2 class="ui header">Generate fake API data for any subject</h2>
    <p>Most mock APIs ship the same canned datasets. Fake API uses AI to generate <strong>fresh JSON for whatever you ask for</strong>—handy for prototyping, tests, and demos. Uncached requests are limited to 10 per 60 seconds; cached responses are free to refetch.</p>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="six wide column">
        <h3 class="ui header">Try it</h3>
        <p>Enter a content name below and hit submit to generate sample data.</p>
        <form id="api-form" class="ui form">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="api-endpoint">Endpoint</label>
            <div class="ui labeled input">
              <div class="ui label">
                ../api/
              </div>
              <input type="text" id="api-endpoint" name="endpoint" placeholder="people" autocomplete="off">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>Query parameters</label>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="property-param-value">
                Properties
                <i class="question circle icon popup" data-content="Optional fields to include on each item, e.g. id, name, age." data-variation="small"></i>
              </label>
              <input type="text" id="property-param-value" name="properties" disabled placeholder="id,name,age">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="key-param-value">
                Key
                <i class="question circle icon popup" data-content="Nest the payload under this path. Default is data. Use slashes for nesting, e.g. data/v1." data-variation="small"></i>
              </label>
              <input type="text" id="key-param-value" disabled name="key" placeholder="data/v1">
            </div>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="ui button primary fluid">Generate</button>
        </form>
      </div>
      <div class="ten wide right floated column">
        <pre class="code-block-wrapper"><code class="language-json" id="api-code-block"></code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
